  "seoBody": "<p>Quickler is priced per firm, not per seat. Pick the plan that fits the number of engineers you have.</p><h2>Plans</h2><ul><li><strong>Starter</strong> &mdash; 1 engineer, 3 workflows, &pound;50 per month.</li><li><strong>Team</strong> &mdash; 4 engineers, 5 workflows, &pound;100 per month.</li><li><strong>Business</strong> &mdash; 12 engineers, 8 workflows, &pound;140 per month.</li><li><strong>Scale</strong> &mdash; 30 engineers, 10 workflows, &pound;300 per month.</li></ul><h2>Payment</h2><p>We collect by <strong>Direct Debit</strong>. You authorise once; we draw monthly from your bank account. No card numbers stored. You're protected by the Direct Debit Guarantee &mdash; refunds are immediate if anything goes wrong.</p><h2>Upgrading</h2><p>Hit a limit and the dashboard prompts you to upgrade. You pay the pro-rata difference for the rest of the current cycle; the new price applies from the next one.</p><h2>Downgrading</h2><p>Remove engineers until you fit within the lower plan, then accept the downgrade prompt. New price takes effect next cycle.</p><h2>Cancelling</h2><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a>. Your subscription ends at the next billing date. Export your data first &mdash; see <a href=\"/pages/help/privacy.html\">Data &amp; privacy</a>.</p><h2>Invoices</h2><p>Every payment generates an invoice emailed to your primary admin. Need a historical one resent? Email support.</p><p>Still stuck? Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a> &mdash; we reply within one business day.</p>",
